   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, in relation to designated essential\nsupport persons for individuals with disabilities",
    "basePrintNo": "S7884",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7884-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §2828, Pub Health L (as proposed in S.1035-A & A.4685-A)",
    "lawSection": "Public Health Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S7884\n\nSPONSOR: ADDABBO\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the public health law, in relation to designated essen-\ntial support persons for individuals with disabilities\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo clarify that a legal guardian of an individual with a disability is\nalso someone who can designate an essential support person on the indi-\nvidual's behalf, in addition to the individual.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nThis bill amends Chapter 689 of the Laws of 2021 to also allow the legal\nguardian of an individual with a disability as someone who can designate\nan essential support person on the individual's behalf, in addition to\nthe individual.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill would further clarify that the legal guardian of an individual\nwith a disability is also someone who can designate an essential support\nperson on the individual's behalf, in addition to the individual.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis is a new bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
